  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending Wisconsin Constitution art. I, s. 25): The people have the {+inalienable+} right to keep and bear arms [-for security, defense, hunting, recreation-][-,-][- or any other lawful purpose-]{+, which right shall never be infringed. The right of the people to keep and bear arms is a fundamental individual right, and any restriction on that right shall be subject to strict scrutiny+}."
